# Build context for the root Dockerfile (the Rust `gloamy` binary).
# The web UI has its own context and its own web/.dockerignore.
#
# ⚠️  Build-critical paths — excluding any of these breaks `cargo build`:
#   firmware/**                     embedded by src/peripherals via include_str!
#   src/skills/assets/**/SKILL.md   embedded by src/skills via include_str!
#   benches/**                      Cargo.toml declares [[bench]]; cargo fails if absent
#   crates/**                       workspace member `gloamy-robot`
#   .cargo/config.toml              per-target linker/rustflags settings
#   Cargo.lock                      required by `cargo build --locked`
#
# Note: patterns here do not cross `/`, so `*.md` and `assets` only match at the
# context root. Use `**/` prefixes if you ever need to match nested paths.

# VCS and CI metadata
.git
.githooks
.github

# Build artifacts
target
.cache

# The frontend is built from its own context (see web/Dockerfile), and its
# node_modules tree would otherwise dominate this context.
web
node_modules

# Docs, examples, and tests are not needed in runtime images
docs
examples
tests

# Sensitive/local files
.env
.DS_Store
.tmp_*

# Local dev scratch space mounted into the dev containers at runtime
playground

# Large or unnecessary asset/document types
assets
*.md
*.png
*.db
*.db-journal

# Repo metadata not required in image
deny.toml
LICENSE
